51 to 2025 on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids shows September to October came in under 90% of normal in 37 of 75 years. In 2025 on the middle, November to December came in at 49% of normal and October to November at 55%. So far in 2026, March to April sits at 51% of normal on the middle. Every grid had its driest year in 1988, and grid 19695 got 65% of normal that year.</p>"}
